      "transparent": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Browser (Phaser)** → **Cloudflare Pages** — the static game.\n\n**Browser** → **Cloudflare Worker** `cloud-yatra-api` → **Cloudflare D1** (SQLite).\n\n**Signals into Grafana Cloud**\n- Frontend RUM and gameplay events → **Faro** (Loki)\n- Backend request metrics and histograms → **Prometheus** (`/metrics`)\n- Backend structured logs → **Loki**\n- Backend request traces → **Tempo**\n- Database-derived gameplay analytics → **Infinity** (`/stats`, `/leaderboard`)\n\nRuns entirely on free tiers: Cloudflare Pages, Workers, and D1, plus Grafana Cloud free."
      },
